# Copy to cache.env (git-ignored) and set the shared build cache location for
# this build box. The Makefile loads cache.env via `-include cache.env`.
#
#     cp cache.env.example cache.env    # then edit the path below
#
# The cross-compile SDK, the RKNN toolkit, and the compiled models live in this
# cache -- OUTSIDE the repo -- so they are built once per box (by the sibling
# brightsign-sdk-builder repo) and reused by every BrightSign NPU project.
#
# Set an ABSOLUTE path; a relative value resolves against the repo root.
# Default (if unset): ../argus-build-cache (a sibling of this checkout).
#
# A command-line override wins over this file:  make package BS_CACHE_DIR=/path
#
# Example (point this repo at a cache the builder already filled):
# BS_CACHE_DIR := /home/you/src/brightsign-playground/argus-all/argus-build-cache
